<title>CANADA: BC Tel says plans C$634 mln upgrade.</title>
<headline>BC Tel says plans C$634 mln upgrade.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>BC Telecom Inc said Wednesday it plans to invest up to C$634 million in telecommunications infrastructure this year.</p>
<p>The company said it would update equipment, improve telephone service and expand wireless and high-speed communications networks throughout British Columbia.</p>
<p>Chief Executive Brian Canfield said the amount represented record capital investment for the company.</p>
<p>((Reuters Vancouver Bureau (604) 664-7314))</p>
